title **Flowchart Klasifikasi Kekeruhan Sungai\n(Preprocessing + Training ResNet18 - Best Practice)**

|#E3F2FD| **1_Preprocessing_NEW.ipynb** |

start

:**Step 0: Import Libraries**
- NumPy, OpenCV, PIL
- sklearn (train_test_split)
- pathlib, json, random;

:**Step 1: Load Original Images**
- Source: //datasetScrap3///
- Format: .jpg / .png
- Label: **jernih** = 0 (Clear)
          **keruh** = 1 (Turbid)
- Total: **233 gambar asli**;

:**Step 2: Preprocess Images**
- BGR → RGB (cv2.cvtColor)
- Resize → **224 × 224** px
- Normalize → **[0, 1]** (float32 / 255);

:**Step 3: Load All Images**
- Load semua gambar ke memori
- Konversi ke NumPy array
- Shape: (N, 224, 224, 3);

:**Step 4: Split Dataset (70/15/15)**
- **Stratified split** (random_state=42)
- Split 1: 70% Train, 30% Temp
- Split 2: 50/50 Temp → Val & Test;

note right
  **BEST PRACTICE:**
  Split **SEBELUM** augmentasi
  → Tidak ada data leakage
end note

fork
  :Train Set
  **163 gambar** (original);
fork again
  :Val Set
  **35 gambar** (original);
fork again
  :Test Set
  **35 gambar** (original);
end fork

:**Step 5: Augmentasi HANYA Training Set**
- 4× augmentasi per gambar
- Total: 163 + (163 × 4) = **815 gambar**;

note right
  **Teknik Augmentasi:**
  • Rotation ±15°
  • Horizontal Flip (50%)
  • Vertical Flip (50%)
  • Brightness (0.7 – 1.3)
  • Contrast (0.7 – 1.3)
end note

:**Step 6: Save Data (.npy)**
- //data_processed_best_practice///
  ├── train/ (images.npy, labels.npy)
  ├── val/ (images.npy, labels.npy)
  ├── test/ (images.npy, labels.npy)
  └── metadata.json;

:**Step 7: Verifikasi Data**
- Train: **815** gambar (augmented)
- Val: **35** gambar (original)
- Test: **35** gambar (original)
- Cek distribusi kelas;

|#E8F5E9| **2_Training_ResNet18_NEW.ipynb** |

:**Step 1: Import & Setup GPU**
- PyTorch, torchvision
- Device: **CUDA** (RTX 4070 Super)
- VRAM: 12 GB;

:**Step 2: Load Preprocessed Data**
- Source: //data_processed_best_practice///
- Load .npy → NumPy arrays
- Train: 815 | Val: 35 | Test: 35;

:**Step 3: ImageNet Normalization**
- Mean: [0.485, 0.456, 0.406]
- Std: [0.229, 0.224, 0.225]
- Transpose: (N,H,W,C) → **(N,C,H,W)**
- Convert → PyTorch Tensor (float32);

:**Step 4: Create DataLoaders**
- Batch Size: **32**
- NUM_WORKERS: **4**
- pin_memory: **True**
- Train: shuffle=True
- Val/Test: shuffle=False;

:**Step 5: Build ResNet18 Model**
- Pre-trained: **ImageNet** (1000 class)
- Modify FC layer:
  512 → 256 → ReLU → Dropout(0.5) → 2
- Total params: **~11.7M**
- Move to **CUDA**;

:**Step 6: Training Configuration**
- Loss: **CrossEntropyLoss**
- Optimizer: **Adam** (lr=0.001, weight_decay=1e-4)
- Scheduler: **ReduceLROnPlateau**
  (factor=0.5, patience=3)
- Epochs: **50**
- Early Stopping: patience=**10**;

repeat :Epoch 1 → 50;

  partition "**Training Phase**" {
    :model.train()
    Forward pass → Loss
    Backward pass → Update weights
    Hitung Train Loss & Accuracy;
  }

  partition "**Validation Phase**" {
    :model.eval() + torch.no_grad()
    Forward pass → Loss
    Hitung Val Loss & Accuracy;
  }

  :Update Learning Rate
  (scheduler.step);

  if (Val Accuracy **meningkat**?) then (Ya ✅)
    :Simpan **Best Model**
    (resnet18_best.pth)
    Reset patience counter;
  else (Tidak ❌)
    :Increment patience counter
    (counter += 1);
  endif

  if (Patience counter ≥ **10**?) then (Ya ⛔)
    :Early Stopping!;
    break
  else (Tidak)
  endif

repeat while (Epoch selesai?) is (Belum) not (Sudah)

:**Step 8: Save Model & Metadata**
- Model: //resnet18_final_best_practice.pth//
- Metadata: //resnet18_metadata_best_practice.json//
  (history, config, results);

:**Step 9: Plot Training History**
- Loss curve (Train vs Val)
- Accuracy curve (Train vs Val)
- Save: //resnet18_training_history_best_practice.png//;

note right
  **Expected Output:**
  • Best Val Accuracy
  • Best Val Loss
  • Total Epochs trained
  • Training Time
end note

stop

@enduml
